				<guid>http://localhost:58297/projects/3dslibris/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3dsLibris&lt;/strong&gt; is a homebrew ebook reader for Nintendo 3DS.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It focuses on making long-form reading usable on a dual-screen handheld device, with support for formats such as EPUB, CBZ and PDF.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The project explores constrained-device UI, text layout, caching, fixed-layout rendering, and performance-sensitive C/C++ development.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
